  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 305.01 Fees. In addition to any fee imposed by RSA 328-I: 6 or :9, a fee of $110.00 shall be charged by the board for reinstatement of a lapsed registration.\n\nSource. #11091-B, eff 5-5-16\n\nAPPENDIX",
